{
    "title": "Word Garden : Crosswords",
    "description": "Garden of Words is an addictive word puzzle game that challenges your vocabulary and tests your brain. With over a hundred crosswords to play and new levels added regularly, this game will keep you entertained for hours on end.\r\n\r\nThe objective of this word game is simple \u2013 find words hidden in a grid of letters. The words can be arranged in any direction \u2013 vertically, horizontally and can even overlap with each other.\r\n\r\nGarden of Words isn't just any ordinary word search game. It also features crossword  puzzles, where you have to connect letters to form words, and other challenging puzzles that require you to use your logic and strategy skills. You can also compete with other players around the world and climb the leaderboard to become the top word solver.\r\n\r\nHere are the advantages of Garden of Words:\r\n\u25ba A free game without wifi, you can play it all the time, without limit! \r\n\u25ba Multiple difficulty levels for all players, over 8000 levels in 7 languages!\r\n\u25ba Finally a word game you can play with friends: challenge your friends and compare your vocabulary!\r\n\u25ba You can also learn new words every day with the \u201cDaily Puzzle\"\". The Daily Puzzle challenges you every day to find all the words in the correct order. A great way to work on your spelling and your memory!\r\n\u25ba Explore the crossword puzzles through neat graphics, with many varied and colorful settings, to relax and unwind!\r\n\u25ba Unlock lots of bonuses to reward your progress!\r\n\u25ba Find the hidden words: each crossword puzzle is full of words to find that are not in the grid! Work on your memory and your vocabulary to discover them!\r\n\u25ba Hints: to help you, many hints are at your disposal to reveal a letter, or a word!\r\n\r\nThe game is designed to be easy to pick up, but difficult to master. As you progress through the levels, the puzzles become more challenging, and you'll need to find longer and more complex words.\r\n\r\nOverall, Garden of Words is an engaging word game that is perfect for anyone who loves puzzles and wants to improve their vocabulary. With its wide variety of puzzles and themes, it offers something for everyone, from casual players to hardcore word game enthusiasts. So if you're looking for a fun and challenging word puzzle game, look no further than Garden of Words.\r\n\r\n---<b>NEED HELP?</b>---\r\n\r\nRead our FAQ: https://iscool.helpshift.com/a/garden-of-words/?l=en\r\nContact us: support+gardenofwords@iscool-e.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Garden of Words is an addictive word puzzle game that challenges your vocabulary and tests your brain. With over a hundred crosswords to play and new levels added regularly, this game will keep you entertained for hours on end.<br><br>The objective of this word game is simple \u2013 find words hidden in a grid of letters. The words can be arranged in any direction \u2013 vertically, horizontally and can even overlap with each other.<br><br>Garden of Words isn&#39;t just any ordinary word search game. It also features crossword  puzzles, where you have to connect letters to form words, and other challenging puzzles that require you to use your logic and strategy skills. You can also compete with other players around the world and climb the leaderboard to become the top word solver.<br><br>Here are the advantages of Garden of Words:<br>\u25ba A free game without wifi, you can play it all the time, without limit! <br>\u25ba Multiple difficulty levels for all players, over 8000 levels in 7 languages!<br>\u25ba Finally a word game you can play with friends: challenge your friends and compare your vocabulary!<br>\u25ba You can also learn new words every day with the \u201cDaily Puzzle&quot;&quot;. The Daily Puzzle challenges you every day to find all the words in the correct order. A great way to work on your spelling and your memory!<br>\u25ba Explore the crossword puzzles through neat graphics, with many varied and colorful settings, to relax and unwind!<br>\u25ba Unlock lots of bonuses to reward your progress!<br>\u25ba Find the hidden words: each crossword puzzle is full of words to find that are not in the grid! Work on your memory and your vocabulary to discover them!<br>\u25ba Hints: to help you, many hints are at your disposal to reveal a letter, or a word!<br><br>The game is designed to be easy to pick up, but difficult to master. As you progress through the levels, the puzzles become more challenging, and you&#39;ll need to find longer and more complex words.<br><br>Overall, Garden of Words is an engaging word game that is perfect for anyone who loves puzzles and wants to improve their vocabulary. With its wide variety of puzzles and themes, it offers something for everyone, from casual players to hardcore word game enthusiasts. So if you&#39;re looking for a fun and challenging word puzzle game, look no further than Garden of Words.<br><br>---<b>NEED HELP?</b>---<br><br>Read our FAQ: https://iscool.helpshift.com/a/garden-of-words/?l=en<br>Contact us: support+gardenofwords@iscool-e.com",
